# Backend (FastAPI)

## Layout

- Entrypoint: `src/main.py` (CORS, SlowAPI, routers, startup Mongo ping + OpenRouter model logs)
- Feature routers: `api_auth`, `api_decks`, `api_learning`, `api_tags`, `api_import`
- Shared: `db.py` (`db` handle), `utils.py` (JWT/password), `services.py` (SRS)
- Run indexes once: `python src/init_indexes.py`

## Patterns

- Protect routes with `get_current_user` + `Authorization: Bearer …` (`decode_token`).
- Ownership: deck/card lookups must filter by `owner_id` / owned deck (see `api_decks._require_owned_card`).
- Prefer ObjectId try/except → `404`, not 500.
- Card create/update goes through `flashcard_doc_from_payload` / `serialize_card` / `set_card_tags`.
- Tags: `tags` + junction `card_tags`; do not rely on only embedded tag names.
- Rate-limit auth via SlowAPI (`rate_limit.py`).

## Env / AI

- Without `OPENROUTER_API_KEY`: exact/typo grading only; hint/AI endpoints error.
- Distinct models: `OPENROUTER_MODEL_HINT`, `_GRADE`, `_TAG`, `_IMPORT` (import/tag fall back to hint).

## Tests

```bash
cd server && python -m pytest
```

Add/adjust tests under `server/tests/` when changing matching, SRS, auth tokens, or study records.

```python
# ❌ BAD — new route not registered
# only edit api_foo.py

# ✅ GOOD — include in main.py
app.include_router(foo_router)
```
